# 028 · Search every log and session

**Status:** `DROPPED`, merged into [257](257-find-the-fault.goal) · **Version:** [v0.3.0](../roadmap.md#v030) · **Depends on:** [027](027-logs-page.goal)

## What

Keep and search the logs and the agent sessions of every rig: trial transcripts, planner and advisor calls, supervisor and harness logs. Secrets are removed where the logs start. Design first: a store in control with an index, or shipping to an OpenTelemetry collector.

## Why

Debugging a campaign means reading what its agents did, across rigs.

## Done when

- [ ] The owner chose the design.
- [ ] A search across rigs finds a trial's transcript.
- [ ] How long logs are kept is configurable.

## Decisions

- 2026-10-19, owner: Thermite needs a way to process every log and to search every session from its rigs that grows with the fleet.
- 2026-11-10, the owner, with the v0.3.0 plan (goal [242](_completed/242-v030-review.goal)): merged into [257](257-find-the-fault.goal). A rig's log lines reach control with goal 257, kept in control's own store with SQLite's text search. The search of the agents' sessions is an open question of that goal.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the roadmap.
- 2026-11-10: Merged into goal 257.

